OL,3,GNEWSAI fear for my family's health,
OL,4,Asays dad with high levels of PFOA in
OL,5,Ablood
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has described his shock after
OL,8,F"bombshell" results showed he had
OL,9,F"really high levels" of a potentially
OL,10,Fcancer-causing forever chemical in his
OL,11,Fblood.
OL,13,FMario Panteli lives near AGC Chemicals
OL,14,Ffactory, formerly ICI, in
OL,15,FThornton-Cleveleys, Lancashire, which
OL,16,Fused perfluorooctanoic acid (PFOA) in
OL,17,Ftheir manufacturing processes until
OL,18,F2012.
