OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAI fear for my family's health,
OL,4,Asays dad with high levels of PFOA in
OL,5,Ablood
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe is among dozens of residents who
OL,8,Flive near the plant who have been told
OL,9,Fthey could be at elevated risk of
OL,10,Fserious health conditions from the
OL,11,Fsubstance.
OL,13,FThe father-of-five, who has another
OL,14,Fchild on the way, was emotional when he
OL,15,Freceived his results, saying he did not
OL,16,Fexpect to be so impacted by the
OL,17,Fchemicals but his "main concern" was
OL,18,Ffor his children's health.
